Appended system prompt file handling in src/adapter.ts adapts the implementation
from Cindy (https://github.com/makecindy/cindy), commit
6b4829f4b0b14e5d7d5f42cf68a34d5541cec01f, included in release v0.1.112.
Original contribution by Yunjin Zhang; licensed under Apache License 2.0.
Joko modifications bind private prompt files and their content digest to the
existing runtime generation, remote staging, and process recovery lifecycle.
See LICENSE.cindy for the applicable license.

The platform command-line budget guard in the managed subagent sources adapts
the same release's cindy-subagent-runner-source.ts (change c69e8b918).
Windows measures UTF-16 characters; POSIX measures UTF-8 bytes. Joko applies
the guard to foreground and detached children and records failures through
the existing task lifecycle without exposing argument content.
